---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import {
  IconBrandGithub,
  IconBrandLinkedin,
  IconBulb,
  IconClick,
  IconCode,
  IconMail,
  IconUsers,
} from "@tabler/icons-astro";
import Card from "../components/Card.astro";
import H1 from "../components/text/H1.astro";
import H2 from "../components/text/H2.astro";
import H3 from "../components/text/H3.astro";
import CompanyCards from "../components/CompanyCards.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="mb-8" style="padding-right: 40px;">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-1">
      <H1>&gt; halvard_mørstad</H1>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/lmxrd"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          aria-label="GitHub"
        >
          <IconBrandGithub size={16} color="var(--color-dim)" stroke={2} />
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/halvard-mørstad-4b8b13144/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          aria-label="LinkedIn"
        >
          <IconBrandLinkedin size={16} color="var(--color-dim)" stroke={2} />
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:jobs@morstad.eu" aria-label="Email">
          <IconMail size={16} color="var(--color-dim)" stroke={2} />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="m-0 text-muted text-xs mb-2">
      Principal Engineer | Cloud & Infrastructure | Fractional CTO<br/>Founder of <a
          href="https://vardalabs.eu"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          aria-label="VardaLabs"
          class="underline font-medium"
        >VardaLabs</a>
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
      // Cloud and infrastructure engineer, occasionally full-stack.<br />
      // Ten years in, still enjoy picking up a stack I've never touched.<br />
      // These days that extends to leading the people who build alongside me.<br
      />
      // Comfortable down to the metal, Rust, Go, and the occasional x86 detour.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA buttons -->
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 mb-8">
    <a
      href="mailto:jobs@morstad.eu"
      class="btn-primary"
      style="padding: 0.5rem 1rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;"
    >
      $ lets_talk()
    </a>
    <a
      href="/work"
      class="btn-outline"
      style="padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;"
    >
      cd ./work
    </a>
    <a
      href="/blog"
      class="btn-outline"
      style="padding: 0.5rem 0.875rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center;"
    >
      cd ./blog
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Link to non-technical version -->
  <a
    href="/about"
    class="btn-outline"
    style="padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem; font-size: 0.8125rem; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.75rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; text-decoration: none;"
  >
    <IconClick size={28} color="var(--color-link)" stroke={2} />
    <span
      >I can also present to your&nbsp;<br />non-technical stakeholders&nbsp;<br
      />see that view here</span
    >
  </a>

  <!-- Ways to work with me -->
  <H2 class="text-dim mb-2.5">// ways to work with me</H2>
  <section
    class="grid gap-2.5 mb-8"
    style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));"
  >
    <Card>
      <IconCode size={16} color="#85b7eb" stroke={2} />
      <H3 class="mt-2.5 mb-1">Hands-on engineering</H3>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
        Cloud, infra, and full-stack builds you can hand off with confidence.
      </p>
    </Card>
    <Card>
      <IconBulb size={16} color="#f0997b" stroke={2} />
      <H3 class="mt-2.5 mb-1">Advisory and greenfield builds</H3>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
        Pick the right stack, validate before committing budget, or find what's
        broken.
      </p>
    </Card>
    <Card>
      <IconUsers size={16} color="#97c459" stroke={2} />
      <H3 class="mt-2.5 mb-1">Fractional leadership</H3>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
        Interim CTO work, team building, and technical strategy.
      </p>
    </Card>
  </section>

  <!-- About -->
  <div class="pb-5 mt-8">
    <H2 class="text-dim mb-2">// about</H2>
    <p class="m-0 text-muted text-sm mb-3" style="line-height: 1.8;">
      I'm a cloud and infrastructure engineer with a full-stack background. Ten
      years across startups and enterprise, now splitting my time between
      hands-on engineering, technical leadership, and freelance work.
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 mb-1.5 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <span class="text-dim mr-4">// leadership</span>
      I've led teams of up to 12 engineers, set technical direction, and mentored
      juniors. I'm comfortable as interim CTO or embedding into an existing team.
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 mb-1.5 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <span class="text-dim mr-4">// adaptability</span>
      I pick up unfamiliar stacks quickly. I'm comfortable across the stack from frontend
      to infrastructure to low-level systems, and I've evaluated and adopted technologies
      for proof-of-concepts and greenfield projects.
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 mb-1.5 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <span class="text-dim mr-4">// mentoring</span>
      I mentor junior engineers and previously taught programming. I also write technical
      content, including a course on Newline.co.
    </p>
    <p class="m-0 mb-1.5 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <span class="text-dim mr-4">// on ai</span>
      AI is a tool, not a replacement. I use it to speed up scaffolding, test generation,
      and code review, but the engineer's job shifts from writing code to evaluating
      it. Get it right and you cut cost and cycle time. Get it wrong and you generate
      more rework than you saved.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Notable companies -->
  <H2 class="text-dim mb-5">// notable companies</H2>
  <CompanyCards />

  <!-- Use cases -->
  <H2 class="text-dim mb-3 mt-8">// what I can do for you</H2>
  <div class="mb-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3">
      <H3 class="text-dim">// migrate to the cloud</H3>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Lift a legacy setup into containerized infra. I handle the migration,
        CI/CD, and cutover with minimal downtime.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3 border-top">
      <H3 class="text-dim">// ship a full-stack app</H3>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        From a blank repo to a deployed product. I build the frontend, API, and
        database layer.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3 border-top">
      <H3 class="text-dim">// harden your infrastructure</H3>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        I audit your current setup, find what's fragile, and make it reliable.
        Observability, autoscaling, and disaster recovery.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3 border-top">
      <H3 class="text-dim">// build a greenfield service</H3>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        When you need to validate an idea fast. I pick the stack, build a PoC,
        and hand it off with docs.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3 border-top">
      <H3 class="text-dim">// lead your engineering team</H3>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Interim or fractional. I set technical direction, mentor your juniors,
        and keep delivery moving.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-3 border-top">
      <H3 class="text-dim">// evaluate a new stack</H3>
      <p class="m-0 text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Before you commit budget, I prototype with the candidate technologies
        and give you a grounded recommendation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="pt-3.5 border-top">
    <p class="m-0 text-dim text-xs">© halvard mørstad</p>
  </footer>
</Layout>
